            "review_text": "lisa d\n5 contributions\n0\nDelicious, quick and easy for a family\nJul 2023 • Family\nWe had been on a long day trip and wanted something quick and easy. As we have been away for over a month the kids were lusting after something western. This was across from our hotel and fitted both requirements. Yummy grilled sandwiches with a jalapeño addition. My boys just inhaled their sandwiches. Great and delicious if you need a break from the thousand options on the street.\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2023",
